-- title:
--   Actual mixed Levy positive-clock stopped HJB reward expected bound
-- statement:
--   For the same original nonzero Gaussian and spectrally negative jump process, and every bounded stopped truncation clock, prove the actual dividend reward expected HJB upper bound restricted to the strictly positive-clock event and weighted by its probability. This exact core suffices for the signed five-witness target through the already-Proved da80762d without conflating unmasked and zero-clock-masked expectations.

